# Glyph of Doom can target an opponent’s Wall and destroys the attacker it blocked.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Steel Wall
Swamp x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Glyph of Doom
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Steel Wall.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
